    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "70681202d77528450c6a": "You need to start learning things that are beyond my expertise! Talk to Lilliam Sparkspindle in front of the tent there. He'll set you on the right course!",
        "d59a1c328d5953153770": "Ah, what a beautiful day to blow something up!",
        "e398ebab200ffe498fc9": "Train me.",
        "feff5d069aa974935338": "This kind of work isn't for the faint of heart. I have an uncle who lost a hand! Poor old Stumpy... anyway, if you're still interested I might be able to show you a few things."
      },
      "name": "Sprite Jumpsprocket",
      "subName": "Journeyman Engineer",
